WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.830 --> 00:00:02.720
You really have to see this next clip.

00:00:02.720 --> 00:00:09.259
I already told you yesterday and we just discussed
in our previous clip Donald Trump's vaccine

00:00:09.259 --> 00:00:15.519
executive order that he signed at yesterday's
vaccine summit, which we don't understand.

00:00:15.519 --> 00:00:22.730
Donald Trump's executive order says that the
U.S. government will work to secure coronavirus

00:00:22.730 --> 00:00:27.369
vaccine doses for the United States before
other countries get them.

00:00:27.369 --> 00:00:33.460
Now, it's not really clear what the enforcement
of that would be.

00:00:33.460 --> 00:00:36.680
It's not clear what enforcement is even legally
possible.

00:00:36.680 --> 00:00:41.560
It's not clear what authority the United States
has to obtain vaccines for us before other

00:00:41.560 --> 00:00:42.920
countries get them.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:46.480
We weren't the only ones confused by this
executive order.

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:51.980
And yesterday, Donald Trump's vaccine chief,
who I'm actually more or less happy with,

00:00:51.980 --> 00:00:57.980
he's been doing a relatively good job at not
politicizing the vaccine program.

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:04.500
He's seemed immune, for lack of a better term,
to pressure from pressure to say things that

00:01:04.500 --> 00:01:05.500
he doesn't believe.

00:01:05.500 --> 00:01:08.170
I'm talking about Dr. Moncef Slaoui.

00:01:08.170 --> 00:01:10.831
He was interviewed by ABC's George Stephanopoulos
yesterday.

00:01:10.831 --> 00:01:12.350
And you have to see this.

00:01:12.350 --> 00:01:17.300
George Stephanopoulos says to him, What is
Trump's vaccine executive order about?

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:18.640
Like what does it do?

00:01:18.640 --> 00:01:20.150
And Slaoui doesn't even pretend.

00:01:20.150 --> 00:01:22.030
He just says, I have no idea whatsoever.

00:01:22.030 --> 00:01:25.140
He just sort of shrugs and raises his eyebrows.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:28.270
He has no this is Trump's vaccine, chief.

00:01:28.270 --> 00:01:31.060
No idea what Trump's executive order is about.

00:01:31.060 --> 00:01:32.060
Check it out.

00:01:32.060 --> 00:01:33.450
It's like a Greek tragedy.

00:01:33.450 --> 00:01:35.580
Explain this executive order the president
is going to be putting out.

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:39.200
I don't quite understand saying that foreign
countries aren't going to be able to get the

00:01:39.200 --> 00:01:41.631
vaccine until everybody here in the United
States gets it.

00:01:41.631 --> 00:01:43.200
It sounds like the problem is the opposite.

00:01:43.200 --> 00:01:46.970
Right now, Pfizer has made deals with other
countries that are going to limit the supply

00:01:46.970 --> 00:01:48.570
here.

00:01:48.570 --> 00:01:51.400
Frankly, I don't know.

00:01:51.400 --> 00:01:56.310
And frankly, I'm saying out of this kind of
comment, I don't know.

00:01:56.310 --> 00:02:01.979
But you're the chief science adviser for Operation
Warp Speed.

00:02:01.979 --> 00:02:03.770
Our work is is rolling.

00:02:03.770 --> 00:02:04.770
We have plans.

00:02:04.770 --> 00:02:06.850
We feel that we can deliver the vaccines as
needed.

00:02:06.850 --> 00:02:08.729
So I don't know exactly what.

00:02:08.729 --> 00:02:12.920
But this order is about just amazing optics.

00:02:12.920 --> 00:02:15.870
Slaoui just washing his hands of this all
together.

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:17.450
I have no idea.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.310
I'm not involved in it, not even pretending
to try to explain it.

00:02:21.310 --> 00:02:27.130
But the key thing here is actually what George
Stephanopoulos says, which is the problem

00:02:27.130 --> 00:02:28.730
is the opposite.

00:02:28.730 --> 00:02:33.450
Trump signing an executive order saying get
us vaccines before other countries, thanks

00:02:33.450 --> 00:02:38.470
to Trump turning down 100 million vaccine
doses in the late summer.

00:02:38.470 --> 00:02:40.990
Other countries are going to get vaccine doses
before us.

00:02:40.990 --> 00:02:44.340
The UK already vaccinating people as one example.

00:02:44.340 --> 00:02:50.150
So the back story again, if you missed yesterday's
show, I'll quickly remind you Trump was offered

00:02:50.150 --> 00:02:54.700
back in late summer the opportunity to get
100 million more doses of the Pfizer vaccine

00:02:54.700 --> 00:02:56.230
secured for the United States.

00:02:56.230 --> 00:02:57.600
And Trump said no.

00:02:57.600 --> 00:03:02.180
And so Pfizer went and sold those doses to
other countries as as they would obviously

00:03:02.180 --> 00:03:03.180
do.

00:03:03.180 --> 00:03:08.099
And that includes the U.K. and some European
Union countries have also secured vaccines.

00:03:08.099 --> 00:03:14.660
Now, we've learned that thanks to that decision,
the U.S. is not likely to get a second tranche

00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:19.670
of the Pfizer vaccine doses until June of
2021.

00:03:19.670 --> 00:03:22.810
This is just because Trump turned down one
hundred million doses.

00:03:22.810 --> 00:03:27.610
So Trump is now panicking and he put together
this completely flaccid, impotent executive

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:31.709
order, which appears to do nothing other than
maybe make it look like he's doing something

00:03:31.709 --> 00:03:36.030
to cover up that failure from the summer when
he could simply have said, yeah, we'll take

00:03:36.030 --> 00:03:37.700
the doses, of course.

00:03:37.700 --> 00:03:43.340
And now you have vaccine chief, Dr. Moncef
Slaoui on national TV saying, I have no idea

00:03:43.340 --> 00:03:44.340
what that is.

00:03:44.340 --> 00:03:47.660
That is about washing his hands completely
and saying I'm not involved.

00:03:47.660 --> 00:03:54.950
Now, one interesting thing is that you can
tell fear of Trump is palpably waning as Trump

00:03:54.950 --> 00:03:57.450
gets closer and closer to being an ex-president.

00:03:57.450 --> 00:04:01.700
Slaoui himself might have answered this question
the same way at any point.

00:04:01.700 --> 00:04:07.490
But in total, when you look at other Republicans
and other people ancillary to the Trump administration,

00:04:07.490 --> 00:04:10.989
they seem more and more willing to just say
things as they are, rather than bending over

00:04:10.989 --> 00:04:15.130
backwards the way we saw them do for so long
to pretend that what Trump is saying and doing

00:04:15.130 --> 00:04:16.930
makes even an iota of sense.

00:04:16.930 --> 00:04:22.930
Now, as far as the executive order, it again
feels sort of like when Donald Trump's dad,

00:04:22.930 --> 00:04:27.770
Fred Trump, was suffering from dementia and
he'd go to his office and he would call people

00:04:27.770 --> 00:04:32.340
on his phone, but the phone would only go
to his secretary and he would shuffle around

00:04:32.340 --> 00:04:37.570
stacks of paper and sign things that were
completely meaningless, as if he was working.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:39.710
Nobody's really paying attention anymore.

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.990
And Trump's executive order, it does nothing.

00:04:41.990 --> 00:04:45.639
It's not even clear what the enforcement would
or could possibly be.

00:04:45.639 --> 00:04:51.080
We're getting into a very strange kind of
lame duck period with Donald Trump.

00:04:51.080 --> 00:04:54.020
And as a reminder, six weeks.

00:04:54.020 --> 00:04:56.059
We have six weeks, I believe, to the day.

00:04:56.059 --> 00:04:57.059
Right.

00:04:57.059 --> 00:04:58.419
I think January 20th is a Wednesday.

00:04:58.419 --> 00:05:05.680
I believe we are six weeks to the day of all
of this all of this ending, and we will all

00:05:05.680 --> 00:05:07.439
be much better for it.

